<title>USA: United Stationers Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>United Stationers Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.63		    $0.29</p>
<p> Net			  9,282		    4,358</p>
<p> Revs		     599,345		  549,412</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	14,764		   14,948</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income includes preferred stock dividends.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.03		    $0.22</p>
<p> Net			 30,249		    2,796</p>
<p> Revs		   2,298,170		1,751,462</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	14,923		   12,809</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income includes preferred stock dividends.</p>
<p>Results for 1995 year include $9.8 million pre-tax restructuring charge and $1.4 million after-tax extraordinary loss.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
